# corpus/calls.fe calls this contract. Alone, it is called by accounts.
Echo 5
Store 7
Stored
Fail 0
Fail 1                    # Error("callee says no")
Overflow 0
Overflow 1                # Panic(0x11)
Sub 5 3
Sub 3 5                   # Panic(0x11)
CallBack                  # the caller is an account, which returns no data
